direction: down
title: Doubly-Linked Sentinels & Monotonic Stack Architecture

DLL: 1. Doubly-Linked List with Sentinels {
  Head: "Head Dummy (null <-)"
  N1: "Node 1 (MRU)"
  N2: "Node 2 (LRU)"
  Tail: "Tail Dummy (-> null)"
  Head <-> N1 <-> N2 <-> Tail
}

StackCache: 2. Monotonic Stack & LRU Cache {
  Stack: "Monotonic Stack\n(Base: 9 > Mid: 5 > Top: 3)"
  Map: "HashMap<Key, Node*>"
  Map -> DLL.N1: "Direct O(1) pointer lookup"
}

DLL -> StackCache: O(1) pointer mutations
